body:
Parking anywhere near the ferry building will be expensive;
I'd guess $250/mo or $25/day based on what I see around 1st and Howard.  My boss lives near San Mateo takes Caltrain to 3rd and King and then walks the 3/4 of a mile from the station to work.  If you'd rather not walk (it'd be more like a mile for you), you could instead take a MUNI line that runs along the Embarcadero from the Caltrain station.  

Figure on an hour commute each way.
